          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze naabuuza Musengwa Katonda nti: “Wo Musengwa Katonda, lwaki ensi eyonooneike n'eba nkalu ng'oti irungu, era ni ghabula omuntu agibitamu? Naani omugezi asobola okutegeera kino? Naani ye wakiinhonhola asobola okukobera abandi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yairamu ati: “Ekyo kiri kityo, lwa kuba abantu baava ku mateeka gange ge nabateeragho. Baaloba okungondera waire okukola bye nabakoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye baakola bw'ebyo emyoyo gyaibwe emikalangufu bye gyenda, nga bajiira ku musambwa Baali nga badhaadha baibwe bwebaabeegeresa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'olw'ekyo, nze Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, Katonda wa Isiraeli, kyenva ni nkoba nti: Bona eno, ndidha kubagha olubiriizi balulye lubakaayire, mbaghe n'amaadhi agalimu eirogo baganhwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidha kubasansaaniza mu maghanga, beene ni badhaadha baibwe, ge batawulirangaku naire. Era ndidha kubasindikaku amagye gabalumbe, okutuusa lwe ndibazikiriza okubamalagho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
